# Cross-repo build order for cascaded rebuilds (used by deb-cascade).
#
# One non-comment line per build step. Repos on the same line have no build
# dependency on each other and can be built in parallel. Each line depends only
# on earlier lines, so every line must be built by CI and published to /staging
# before the next line can build. Names are checkout directory names.
#
# Maintained by hand; the graph changes rarely. It was derived from the
# inter-package build-dependencies (any Build-Depends whose package matches the
# is_our_package heuristic), which are currently:
#
#   liboxenmq              -> oxen-encoding, oxen-logging
#   libquic                -> oxen-encoding, oxen-logging
#   libsession-util        -> oxen-encoding, libquic
#   pyoxenc                -> oxen-encoding
#   lokinet                -> liboxenmq
#   oxen-core              -> liboxenmq, oxen-logging
#   pyoxenmq               -> liboxenmq
#   libsession-python      -> libsession-util
#   session-router         -> liboxenmq, libquic, oxen-encoding, oxen-logging
#   session-storage-server -> liboxenmq, libquic, oxen-encoding, oxen-logging
#   session-pysogs         -> pyoxenc, pyoxenmq
#
# When editing: keep every repo on a line strictly later than all of its
# dependencies above.

oxen-encoding oxen-logging
liboxenmq libquic pyoxenc
libsession-util lokinet oxen-core pyoxenmq session-router session-storage-server
libsession-python session-pysogs
